id/1  1 guard (body cannot benefit; isolates entry cost)     +4 (+0.8%)     +3 (+4.5%)      +0      +0      +1
id/1  NOISE FLOOR: two identical unguarded modules           +0 (+0.0%)     +0 (+0.0%)      +0      +0      +0
