amt/1 tuple discriminator (is_tuple+tuple_size+element)      -4 (-0.7%)   +13 (+17.8%)      -2     -12      +4

columns d_file / d_Code are `+N (+P%)`; the rest are absolute bytes,
except d_inst which counts instructions.

